{"version":1,"page":{"kind":"annotation-detail","href":"/shijing/annotation/070-tu-yuan/wangli-yundu","dataHref":"/__data/shijing/annotation/070-tu-yuan/wangli-yundu/data.json","title":"詩經韻讀 · 兔爰 · 注释总览","description":"風 · 王風 · 兔爰 · 汇集《詩經韻讀》关于《兔爰》的 1 条注释，含 1 条注脚。"},"payload":{"detail":{"route":{"poemId":"070-tu-yuan","materialId":"wangli-yundu"},"href":"/shijing/annotation/070-tu-yuan/wangli-yundu","poem":{"id":"070-tu-yuan","title":"兔爰","categoryId":"feng","subcategoryId":"wangfeng","path":["風","王風","兔爰"],"segments":[{"id":"seg-001","text":"有兔爰爰","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-002","text":"雉离于罗","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-003","text":"我生之初","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-004","text":"尚无为","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-005","text":"我生之后","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-006","text":"逢此百罹","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-007","text":"尚寐无吪","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-008","text":"有兔爰爰","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-009","text":"雉离于罦","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-010","text":"我生之初","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-011","text":"尚无造","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-012","text":"我生之后","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-013","text":"逢此百忧","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-014","text":"尚寐无觉","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-015","text":"有兔爰爰","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-016","text":"雉离于罿","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-017","text":"我生之初","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-018","text":"尚无庸","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-019","text":"我生之后","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-020","text":"逢此百凶","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-021","text":"尚寐无聪","isActive":true}]},"material":{"id":"wangli-yundu","title":"詩經韻讀","authors":["王力"],"contributorLine":"现代 · 王力","era":"现代","publicationYear":1980,"carrier":"PDF"},"stats":{"annotationCount":1,"glossCount":1},"annotations":[{"id":"0001","order":1,"total":1,"layer":"span","layerLabel":"诗句片段","targetText":"有兔爰爰，雉离于罗，我生之初，尚无为，我生之后，逢此百罹，尚寐无吪，有兔爰爰，雉离于罦，我生之初，尚无造，我生之后，逢此百忧，尚寐无觉，有兔爰爰，雉离于罿，我生之初，尚无庸，我生之后，逢此百凶，尚寐无聪。","targetNotes":"全篇韵读。","sourceLabel":"第 179-180 页","sourceNotes":"据 /tmp/070-tu-yuan-preview/wangli-187.png 至 wangli-188.png（页码 179-180）定位。","notes":null,"glosses":[{"key":"0001-1","attributionLabel":"王力","sectionLabel":"韵读","text":"王力在《韵读》中录《兔爰》三章，并依韵部转注其声读：首章“罗、为、罹、吪”归歌部，次章“罦、忧”入幽部而“觉”转入幽觉通韵，末章“罿、凶、聪”归东部。全诗仍以兔雉陷网起兴，层层写乱世百罹、百忧、百凶之感。","notes":null}]}]}}}
